{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131561925","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin</span></span>"},"pageid":78576406,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Seal_of_Wisconsin.svg/330px-Seal_of_Wisconsin.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Seal_of_Wisconsin.svg/960px-Seal_of_Wisconsin.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":630,"height":630},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383328366","tid":"d8117d58-d66d-11f1-a289-1072865b283c","timestamp":"2026-11-02T03:31:09Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Wisconsin"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the eight U.S. representatives from the state of Wisconsin, one from each of the state's eight congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary election took place on August 11, 2026.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Wisconsin</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the eight U.S. representatives from the state of Wisconsin, one from each of the state's eight congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary election took place on August 11, 2026.</p>"}